+/**
+ * Seemless (VK_EXT_robustness2 nullDescriptor): a zero-filled, resident MTLBuffer
+ * that null buffer descriptors point at, so a shader reading through a null
+ * descriptor reads zeros instead of dereferencing address 0. Sized for the largest
+ * D3D12 constant buffer (64 KiB). Created by the first MVKDevice with a residency
+ * set and added to every such device's set; nil before that.
+ */
+id<MTLBuffer> mvkGetNullDescriptorMTLBuffer();
